+   /* FEX link (fex4, TU_FEX_MODE_DEPTH_CLEAR_FASTZ): a depth/stencil-only
+    * clear runs with the fragment shader disabled, like a depth-only pipeline
+    * (tu_calc_disable_fs): no color is written and the clear fragment shader
+    * outputs nothing, the depth comes from the vertex shader's position. The
+    * app's next draw re-emits these registers with its draw states. */
